{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Benchmarks"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"See how FirebladeECS revisions compare on a shared workload suite, and run the comparison yourself."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/GettingStartedWithFirebladeECS","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReadingAndWritingComponents","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ComponentMacro","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReactingToNexusEvents","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ChoosingAStorage","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SavingAndLoadingScenes","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/MigratingToFirebladeECS2","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEvent","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventDelegate","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventMask","doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus\/StorageKind"],"generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The benchmark suite measures the same workloads at several committed FirebladeECS revisions, such as a release tag against ","type":"text"},{"code":"main","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The workloads cover entity creation, destruction and lookup, adding and removing components, iterating families, system updates and component events. Revisions with value-type components run each workload on both the ","type":"text"},{"code":"archetype","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and the ","type":"text"},{"code":"sparseSet","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" storage (see ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ChoosingAStorage","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"), so a report also shows what the storage choice costs.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"How-results-are-made-trustworthy","text":"How results are made trustworthy","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each revision is built once and measured in ","type":"text"},{"code":"k","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" independent process replicates, interleaved in a seeded random order. The replicate is the unit of analysis: the centre value is the median of the replicate medians, with a distribution-free order-statistic 95% confidence interval. A speed-up against the baseline is the Hodges–Lehmann estimate with its exact confidence interval, tested with an exact Mann–Whitney test and adjusted across all comparisons of a report with Benjamini–Hochberg. A change counts as ","type":"text"},{"code":"faster","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"slower","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" only when it is significant and clears the ±5% equivalence zone; an interval inside that zone is reported as ","type":"text"},{"code":"equivalent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", anything else as ","type":"text"},{"code":"inconclusive","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Read-and-reproduce","text":"Read and reproduce","level":3},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The first published report comes with the 2.0.0 release.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The statistical design and workload parity notes: "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/fireblade-engine\/ecs\/blob\/main\/Documentation\/Benchmarks\/Methodology.md"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To measure revisions locally, pass comma-separated tags, branches or commit IDs. Results are saved under ","type":"text"},{"code":"Benchmarks\/Results\/<UTC timestamp>\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["make benchmark-compare REFS=1.4.3,main REPLICATES=10 BENCHMARK_FILTER='.*'","make benchmark-report RESULTS=\"Benchmarks\/Results\/<run>\/*.json\" REPORT_BASELINE=1.4.3"],"syntax":"sh"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Without ","type":"text"},{"code":"BENCHMARK_FILTER","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" only 16 entities of every workload plus ","type":"text"},{"code":"entity.create.no-entities","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (which only has 0 entities) run. ","type":"text"},{"code":"make benchmark-report","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" renders the single file ","type":"text"},{"code":"BenchmarkReport.html","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" from saved results and never runs benchmarks. See ","type":"text"},{"code":"Benchmarks\/README.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for all options.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Benchmarks","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/benchmarks"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS"]]},"kind":"article","references":{"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/SavingAndLoadingScenes":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Store a whole ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus"},{"text":" on disk and load it again with the same entities, components and entity identifiers.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SavingAndLoadingScenes","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/savingandloadingscenes","title":"Saving and Loading Scenes","role":"article","kind":"article"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/MigratingToFirebladeECS2":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/MigratingToFirebladeECS2","title":"Migrating to FirebladeECS 2","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/migratingtofirebladeecs2","kind":"article","role":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Move a project from FirebladeECS 1.x to 2.0: components become value types, and every write goes through the nexus."}]},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS":{"role":"collection","title":"FirebladeECS","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A lightweight, fast and easy to use Entity-Component System in Swift."}],"url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/Nexus/StorageKind":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/nexus\/storagekind","title":"Nexus.StorageKind","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"StorageKind","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The storage a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" keeps its entities and components in.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"StorageKind","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus\/StorageKind"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/ReadingAndWritingComponents":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Read a copy, replace a component or change it in place."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReadingAndWritingComponents","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/readingandwritingcomponents","title":"Reading and writing components","role":"article","kind":"article"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/ReactingToNexusEvents":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Observe structural changes and, on request, changes of component values."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ReactingToNexusEvents","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/reactingtonexusevents","title":"Reacting to Nexus events","role":"article","kind":"article"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/NexusEventMask":{"title":"NexusEventMask","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"NexusEventMask"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"NexusEventMask"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventMask","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The kinds of events a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/NexusEventDelegate","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" subscribes to."}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/nexuseventmask"},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/ChoosingAStorage":{"role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/firebladeecs\/choosingastorage","title":"Choosing a storage","kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Pick the sparse-set or the archetype storage for a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/Nexus","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", and know what changes.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/ChoosingAStorage"},"https://github.com/fireblade-engine/ecs/blob/main/Documentation/Benchmarks/Methodology.md":{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/fireblade-engine\/ecs\/blob\/main\/Documentation\/Benchmarks\/Methodology.md","type":"link","title":"Methodology.md","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/fireblade-engine\/ecs\/blob\/main\/Documentation\/Benchmarks\/Methodology.md","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Methodology.md"}]},"doc://FirebladeECS/documentation/FirebladeECS/NexusEventDelegate":{"title